@prefix ds: <https://ds.canonical.com/>.
@prefix anatomy: <https://anatomy.canonical.com/>.
@prefix dt: <https://dt.canonical.com/>.

ds:sites.component.store_card a ds:Component;
    ds:name "StoreCard";
    ds:summary "The Store card is a dense, fully clickable result item for a snap, rock, charm, or solution in Canonical software stores and marketplaces. It lets people scan and compare artefacts, then open the selected artefact's detail page without unnecessary intermediate navigation.\n\nUse it in search, browse, explore, and other result listings in Snap Store, Charmhub, and future stores. It is the right UI block when each result has a common identity, a short description, stable classification, and time-sensitive metadata. It is not intended for editorial content, multi-action management tasks, or a detail-page summary.\n\nThe component has a body-and-footer skeleton. Stores choose their relevant optional metadata while retaining a consistent visual hierarchy and interaction model.";
    ds:anatomyDsl "Each root is a size variant of the same Store card \n\n```yaml\nsmall:\n  node:\n    uri: stores:component:StoreCardSmall\n    styles:\n      layout.type: stack\n      layout.direction: vertical\n      size.width: 280px\n      size.height: 224px\n      appearance.background: color/background/default\n      appearance.border: border/default\n      interaction.cursor: pointer\n    edges:\n      - node:\n          role: card body\n          styles:\n            layout.type: stack\n            layout.direction: vertical\n            spacing.internal: spacing/16\n            appearance.border.bottom: border/divider\n          edges:\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardIdentifier\n                styles:\n                  layout.type: flow\n                  layout.direction: horizontal\n                  spacing.gap: spacing/8\n                  typography.name.max-lines: 2\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1\"\n                slotName: identifier\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardDescriptor\n                styles:\n                  typography.style: text/primary/root\n                  typography.max-lines: 2\n                  layout.overflow: ellipsis\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1\"\n                slotName: descriptor\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:PermanentQualities\n                styles:\n                  layout.type: flow\n                  layout.direction: horizontal\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1..*\"\n                slotName: qualities\n        relation:\n          cardinality: \"1\"\n          slotName: body\n      - node:\n          uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardFooter\n          styles:\n            layout.type: flow\n            layout.direction: horizontal\n            layout.justify: start\n            spacing.internal: spacing/8 spacing/16\n            appearance.border.top: border/divider\n          edges:\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:FreshQualities\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1..*\"\n                slotName: start\n        relation:\n          cardinality: \"1\"\n          slotName: footer\n\nmedium:\n  node:\n    uri: stores:component:StoreCardMedium\n    styles:\n      layout.type: stack\n      layout.direction: vertical\n      size.width: 436px\n      size.height: 200px\n      appearance.background: color/background/default\n      appearance.border: border/default\n      interaction.cursor: pointer\n    edges:\n      - node:\n          role: card body\n          styles:\n            layout.type: stack\n            layout.direction: vertical\n            spacing.internal: spacing/16\n            appearance.border.bottom: border/divider\n          edges:\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardIdentifier\n                styles:\n                  layout.type: flow\n                  layout.direction: horizontal\n                  spacing.gap: spacing/8\n                  typography.name.max-lines: 1\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1\"\n                slotName: identifier\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardDescriptor\n                styles:\n                  typography.style: text/primary/root\n                  typography.max-lines: 2\n                  layout.overflow: ellipsis\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1\"\n                slotName: descriptor\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:PermanentQualities\n                styles:\n                  layout.type: flow\n                  layout.direction: horizontal\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1..*\"\n                slotName: qualities\n        relation:\n          cardinality: \"1\"\n          slotName: body\n      - node:\n          uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardFooter\n          styles:\n            layout.type: flow\n            layout.direction: horizontal\n            layout.justify: start\n            spacing.internal: spacing/8 spacing/16\n            appearance.border.top: border/divider\n          edges:\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:FreshQualities\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1..*\"\n                slotName: start\n        relation:\n          cardinality: \"1\"\n          slotName: footer\n\nlong:\n  node:\n    uri: stores:component:StoreCardLong\n    styles:\n      layout.type: stack\n      layout.direction: vertical\n      size.width: 904px\n      size.height: 140px\n      appearance.background: color/background/default\n      appearance.border: border/default\n      interaction.cursor: pointer\n    edges:\n      - node:\n          role: card body\n          styles:\n            layout.type: flow\n            layout.direction: horizontal\n            spacing.internal: spacing/16\n            spacing.gap: spacing/8\n            appearance.border.bottom: border/divider\n          edges:\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardIdentifier\n                styles:\n                  layout.type: flow\n                  layout.direction: horizontal\n                  spacing.gap: spacing/8\n                  typography.name.max-lines: 2\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1\"\n                slotName: identifier\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardDescriptor\n                styles:\n                  typography.style: text/primary/root\n                  typography.max-lines: 3\n                  layout.overflow: ellipsis\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1\"\n                slotName: descriptor\n        relation:\n          cardinality: \"1\"\n          slotName: body\n      - node:\n          uri: stores:subcomponent:StoreCardFooter\n          styles:\n            layout.type: flow\n            layout.direction: horizontal\n            layout.justify: space-between\n            spacing.internal: spacing/8 spacing/16\n            appearance.border.top: border/divider\n          edges:\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:PermanentQualities\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1..*\"\n                slotName: start\n            - node:\n                uri: stores:subcomponent:FreshQualities\n              relation:\n                cardinality: \"1..*\"\n                slotName: end\n        relation:\n          cardinality: \"1\"\n          slotName: footer\n```";
    ds:anatomyClassic "### Source of truth Figma file\n\n{\"Name\":\"26.10 Stores card workshop - Store - Document\",\"Image\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://figma-alpha-api.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/images/82d00420-072a-416c-8416-433cb7dab2f0\",\"outline\":true},\"Url\":{\"type\":\"urlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.figma.com/design/Fi4HFPeKJd6piB5hVxXWC4/26.10-Stores-card-workshop---Store?node-id=803-24503\",\"name\":\"\"},\"Modified\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"10/20/2026 1:21:44 PM\",\"epoch\":1792495304,\"formatted\":\"10/20/2026\"},\"ModifiedBy\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Figma\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/b41ea5bb2cbd89cf1620699952746936?size=240&default=https%3A%2F%2Fs3-alpha.figma.com%2Fstatic%2Fuser_f_v2.png\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Comments\":{\"type\":\"arr\",\"value\":[{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"make truncated examples\",\"Id\":\"1913835114\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"9/4/2026 3:17:58 PM\",\"epoch\":1788527878.174,\"formatted\":\"9/4/2026\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"9/7/2026 9:12:43 AM\",\"epoch\":1788765163.935,\"formatted\":\"9/7/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"add rules for what gets truncated and what doesn't\",\"Id\":\"1912094257\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"9/3/2026 3:33:49 PM\",\"epoch\":1788442429.476,\"formatted\":\"9/3/2026\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"9/4/2026 3:18:30 PM\",\"epoch\":1788527910.233,\"formatted\":\"9/4/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"doesn't work when in hover state ://////\",\"Id\":\"1905845797\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"8/31/2026 9:34:28 AM\",\"epoch\":1788161668.008,\"formatted\":\"8/31/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"test in context of sites and apps\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"assume it occupies 100% width, not a col-2, use full width to test out to see how it looks as it goes through the compression points and how it adapts\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1895162870\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"8/21/2026 4:16:44 PM\",\"epoch\":1787321804.459,\"formatted\":\"8/21/2026\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"9/1/2026 9:54:02 AM\",\"epoch\":1788249242.917,\"formatted\":\"9/1/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"MUST UPDATE TO DOC WITH THESE CARDS\",\"Id\":\"1893520988\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"8/20/2026 5:01:40 PM\",\"epoch\":1787238100.239,\"formatted\":\"8/20/2026\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"8/21/2026 2:57:46 PM\",\"epoch\":1787317066.104,\"formatted\":\"8/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"test with lighter colour category tag to make it feel less dense but still at the density we want it to be\",\"Id\":\"1861760945\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/28/2026 5:30:28 PM\",\"epoch\":1785252628.693,\"formatted\":\"7/28/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"long card versions\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"middle and right following the 600px rule\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"right is more scalable than middle\"}],\"id\":\"cl-2\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1861749517\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/28/2026 5:24:37 PM\",\"epoch\":1785252277.267,\"formatted\":\"7/28/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"this isn't going to work. this version is no scalable at all.\",\"Id\":\"1861718194\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/28/2026 5:09:15 PM\",\"epoch\":1785251355.504,\"formatted\":\"7/28/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"make sure to update this section's explanation once long cards have been finalised\",\"Id\":\"1859834177\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/27/2026 5:32:10 PM\",\"epoch\":1785166330.764,\"formatted\":\"7/27/2026\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"8/21/2026 3:25:45 PM\",\"epoch\":1787318745.355,\"formatted\":\"8/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"what if we make the tags a lighter colour, check og snap cards mattea made a while ago\",\"Id\":\"1856011316\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/23/2026 5:02:32 PM\",\"epoch\":1784818952.36,\"formatted\":\"7/23/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"experiment more with layouts and different content density (more/less text)\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"try something like below\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1855834080\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/23/2026 3:42:36 PM\",\"epoch\":1784814156.315,\"formatted\":\"7/23/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"vibe code responsiveness of cards within its context\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"in context of stores with pragma gird (same responsiveness as sites grid where it doesn't stretch infinitely)\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1855826684\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/23/2026 3:39:13 PM\",\"epoch\":1784813953.601,\"formatted\":\"7/23/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"vibe code:\\n* responsiveness (on phone/tablet/laptop)\\n* hover interactivity (of main card)\\n* hover interactivity (of card content)\\n* focus interactivity (of main card)\\n* layout of a card in responsive setting (how does the content move around when going from a long->medium->small card and vice versa)\\n* interactivity of things within a card\\n* visited state of card\",\"Id\":\"1855822849\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/23/2026 3:37:23 PM\",\"epoch\":1784813843.361,\"formatted\":\"7/23/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"small/medium cards are too dense\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"long cards, need to be formatted better \\ntext width must be 40rem/600px\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1855817936\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/23/2026 3:35:12 PM\",\"epoch\":1784813712.038,\"formatted\":\"7/23/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"I only worry is that 'latest stable' doesn't look interactive so people might not even hover over it\",\"Id\":\"1855318080\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/23/2026 11:11:59 AM\",\"epoch\":1784797919.519,\"formatted\":\"7/23/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"@Leia I went into a bit of a rabbit hole with snaps, and just like charms, there is no coherent or consistent format for defining versions ://///////////////////\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"So, my proposition is unfortunately to get rid of the version indicator on the card and place the download indicator in the footer\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"We should bring this up in the stores weekly, but we are not going to get a solution for fixing the versioning format anytime soon, so we would inevitably have to remove the version indicator altogether for snaps as well ://///\"}],\"id\":\"cl-2\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1852216341\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/21/2026 6:25:41 PM\",\"epoch\":1784651141.18,\"formatted\":\"7/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"i vote one of these\",\"Id\":\"1852088085\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/21/2026 5:15:14 PM\",\"epoch\":1784646914.309,\"formatted\":\"7/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"I vote this one for medium card\",\"Id\":\"1852082729\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/21/2026 5:12:38 PM\",\"epoch\":1784646758.123,\"formatted\":\"7/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"I vote this one for the small card\",\"Id\":\"1852082295\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/21/2026 5:12:25 PM\",\"epoch\":1784646745.837,\"formatted\":\"7/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"@Leia 2 things to vote on here\\n* which loading state card to use for each card size\\n* which gray colour to use (examples are using gray 40)\",\"Id\":\"1852081828\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/21/2026 5:12:12 PM\",\"epoch\":1784646732.061,\"formatted\":\"7/21/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"one of these layouts\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"static to the left\\ndynamic to the right\"}],\"id\":\"cl-1\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"}]}},\"Id\":\"1848006353\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Miguel Divo\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/a66fc895-d1cf-4242-939b-52ef7c903106\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/17/2026 2:52:25 PM\",\"epoch\":1784292745.619,\"formatted\":\"7/17/2026\"},\"Resolved\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/17/2026 5:44:39 PM\",\"epoch\":1784303079.258,\"formatted\":\"7/17/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"when on mobile, charm and solution card would be very similar?\",\"Id\":\"1844448749\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Leia\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5d0d2256-562c-4bc9-be14-57a16cf92beb\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/15/2026 3:21:14 PM\",\"epoch\":1784121674.002,\"formatted\":\"7/15/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":\"When spread out, it feels like the footer reads like a table.\",\"Id\":\"1844427506\",\"User\":{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Handle\":\"Leia\",\"Avatar\":{\"type\":\"imageurlref\",\"url\":\"https://s3-alpha.figma.com/profile/5d0d2256-562c-4bc9-be14-57a16cf92beb\",\"outline\":true}}},\"Created\":{\"type\":\"dt\",\"input\":\"7/15/2026 3:11:11 PM\",\"epoch\":1784121071.695,\"formatted\":\"7/15/2026\"}}},{\"type\":\"obj\",\"value\":{\"Message\":{\"type\":\"slate\",\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"Need to create templates of what the cards would like when its being stretched/compressed before reaching the breakpoints\"}],\"id\":\"cl-0\",\"lineLevel\":0,\"style\":\"Paragraph\",\"type\":\"Line\"},{\"alignment\":\"Left\",\"children\":[{\"text\":\"add these grids to a the respective frame sizes (desktop, tablet, phone) to test the r